---
// CoreOfferings.astro
---
<section id="services" class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-brand-dark relative border-y border-brand-primary/10 overflow-hidden">
  {/* Ambient blue glow */}
  <div class="absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-brand-primary/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-center">

      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 animate-on-scroll">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-6">Your Unfair Local <span class="text-brand-orange">Advantage.</span></h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-muted mb-8">
          Most web designers just make things look pretty. We are a growth engine disguised as a web agency. Here is exactly how we take over your local market.
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-6">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="mt-1 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/20 border border-brand-primary/40 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary"></span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-1">Custom Web Development</h4>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-sm">Tailored specifically to your business model, whether you run a clinic, gym, or retail shop.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="mt-1 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-green/20 border border-brand-green/40 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-green"></span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-1">Local SEO Foundation</h4>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-sm">Optimized for Google My Business and local search queries so nearby customers find you first.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="mt-1 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-orange/20 border border-brand-orange/40 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-orange"></span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-white font-bold mb-1">Ongoing Maintenance</h4>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-sm">Secure hosting, daily backups, and continuous updates handled entirely by our team.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="glass-card p-2 relative">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-brand-primary/20 via-brand-green/5 to-brand-orange/10 rounded-2xl"></div>
          {/* Mock Dashboard */}
          <div class="bg-brand-dark rounded-xl border border-brand-primary/20 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl relative z-10">
            <div class="border-b border-brand-primary/10 bg-brand-card/50 p-4 flex gap-2">
               <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand-orange/80"></div>
               <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/80"></div>
               <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-brand-green/80"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <div class="flex justify-between items-end mb-8">
                <div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-brand-muted mb-1">Total New Leads</div>
                  <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">+124 this month</div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-brand-green flex items-center gap-1 font-bold text-lg">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6" /></svg>
                  28%
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-brand-muted mb-1"><span>Google Traffic</span><span>80%</span></div>
                  <div class="h-2 bg-brand-card rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="h-full bg-brand-primary w-[80%] rounded-full"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-brand-muted mb-1"><span>Lead Conversions</span><span>60%</span></div>
                  <div class="h-2 bg-brand-card rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="h-full bg-brand-orange w-[60%] rounded-full"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-brand-muted mb-1"><span>Revenue Growth</span><span>45%</span></div>
                  <div class="h-2 bg-brand-card rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="h-full bg-brand-green w-[45%] rounded-full"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
